  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LeagueVR.Champions.ChampionDefinition
  id: 9
  title: the Visionary
  role: Mage / Support
  passiveName: Signature of the Visionary
  passiveDescription: A spell marks the enemies it hits for 4 seconds; hitting a marked enemy with a different spell completes his signature beneath it, which bursts 0.85 seconds later for 40-285 (by level) +35% AP magic damage around where it was.
  patch: 16.20.1
  portrait: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 272cc0377fdfcb4439681a5836d5eb88, type: 3}
  passiveIcon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 14c0c2112421c4845918f039259e54e4, type: 3}
  spells:
  - name: 'Subject: Disaster'
    vrDescription: 'B opens Disaster: the brush turns red-orange. Then B, X or A (hold to aim with the brush, release to paint): Devastating Fire, a fireball that bursts on the first enemy; Severing Bolt, lightning on a far spot after 1 second (more against a lone or immobile enemy the more health it is missing); Molten Fissure, seven eruptions along a line that leave slowing lava.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 190dfbe13967f9e45ba3953e63ace03e, type: 3}
    cooldowns:
    - 10
    - 9
    - 8
    - 7
    - 6
    costs:
    - 80
    - 90
    - 100
    - 110
    - 120
  - name: 'Subject: Serenity'
    vrDescription: 'X opens Serenity: the brush turns cyan. Then B, X or A: Fleeting Current, a stream that speeds you up while you stand in it; Pool of Reflection, a pool that shields you while you are inside; Stirring Lights, three lights whose next attacks or spells deal bonus damage and give mana back.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: c7b1cb3f9b5044448b626f3d23104508, type: 3}
    cooldowns:
    - 18
    - 17.5
    - 17
    - 16.5
    - 16
    costs:
    - 90
    - 95
    - 100
    - 105
    - 110
  - name: 'Subject: Torment'
    vrDescription: 'A opens Torment: the brush turns magenta. Then B, X or A: Grim Visage, a face that makes the first enemy flee; Gaze of the Abyss, an eye that strikes and roots the first enemy to come near; Crushing Maw, jaws that bite and drag enemies in, slowing them. In any subject the left trigger is Wash Brush: it leaves the subject at no cost.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: d419c3708194e97438c63d88c8f066e6, type: 3}
    cooldowns:
    - 12
    - 11.5
    - 11
    - 10.5
    - 10
    costs:
    - 50
    - 55
    - 60
    - 65
    - 70
  - name: Spiraling Despair
    vrDescription: 'Left trigger (outside a subject): hold and both hands take the staff and point it where you look; release to fire. It sticks to the first enemy champion it meets (or settles where you looked), slows more and more for 3 seconds and then bursts.'
    icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: e734a51a0e2cd6545a35215759d5061f, type: 3}
    cooldowns:
    - 120
    - 100
    - 80
    costs:
    - 100
    - 100
    - 100
